    "changelog": "Initial pack, anchored on s.66 BOFIA 2020 and s.54 TPPA 2022. Section numbers, retention periods, CTR thresholds and training frequency are flagged unconfirmed in the research and are seeded as draft. The May 2025 exposure draft \"Baseline Standards for Automated AML Solutions\" signals a coming automation mandate and is not modelled. Every date, threshold and penalty in this pack is drawn from the phase-8 research brief and has NOT been confirmed against the regulator’s primary document. The pack ships unverified: its records are usable internally but excluded from generated regulatory submissions until a person verifies them (rule R10).",
